Changed files (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): every file but
nxos_show_vlan_brief.json and LICENSE was run through cmd/sanitize, which
replaced addresses, MACs and domains with documentation values. By hand,
hostnames became dev1, serials SERIAL<n>, model numbers MODEL<n> and firmware
versions and image names fw<n>, SNMP contact and location noc and site1.
The running-config files lost their secret lines (enable, username, SNMP
community and user), timestamps and one password-policy line. Whitespace inside JSON strings and the
NX-OS LLDP file's name changed as listed in SOURCE.
